GoRadio {{VERSION}} ({{GOOS}}/{{GOARCH}})
=====================================

Full docs: https://goradioserver.github.io/goradio/

1. Copy server.example.yaml to server.yaml and set a real auth.jwt_secret.

   {{BIN}} serve --config server.yaml

2. Mint a token authorizing a station slug (must match the secret above):

   {{BIN}} tokengen -secret <jwt_secret> myfm

3. Copy station.example.yaml to station.yaml, paste the token from step 2
   into its auth.jwt field.

   {{BIN}} station --config station.yaml --script station.lua myfm "My FM"

   station.lua is a minimal starter script -- open it and add some audio
   files to the `playlist` table to hear something other than silence.

4. Listen at: http://<server.yaml http.listen_addr>/stream/myfm

Editing station.lua in VS Code? Open this folder (not just the file) and
install the "Lua" extension (sumneko.lua) for autocomplete/type-checking
against the radio/http/sql/redis APIs -- lua-types/ and .luarc.json here
are already set up for it.
